UPDATE companies SET description='H S Automotive Alabama Inc operates from Enterprise, Alabama, as a U.S. subsidiary of South Korea''s Hwaseung Group, a major automotive parts supplier that holds the number one domestic market share in Korea. The Alabama location is part of Hwaseung''s overseas expansion strategy, which includes subsidiaries in China, India, Europe, and South America.

