UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1974 in Grangeville, Idaho, Idaho Sewing for Sports began as a small local business sewing truck seats. Co-founders Will and Gail Williams identified a need for quality padding in the ski industry over 40 years ago. The company is woman-owned and operates as an Idaho-based U.S. manufacturer.

The company designs and manufactures custom safety padding for ski areas, gyms, and sports venues across North America. Production takes place at their Idaho facility where a team of skilled craftsmen and designers produces thousands of pads annually. They use heavy-duty UV-resistant vinyl, high-density foam, and closed-cell foam, with capabilities including custom sewing, made-to-order sizing, custom colors and logos, and sustainable recyclable options introduced in 2022.

Idaho Sewing serves ski areas (600+ worldwide), athletic facilities (schools, rec centers, stadiums), playgrounds and parks, adventure parks, climbing gyms, ropes courses, and amusement parks. Customers include ski resorts such as Brooks Lake Lodge and Four Seasons Ski Center, which have used their tubing products since 1995.

The company emphasizes personal customer service, with padding experts guiding clients from quote through design, manufacturing, and delivery. Their differentiation includes nearly 50 years of expertise, all-weather materials, custom-fit solutions, and pioneering the industry''s first 100% recyclable padding. They are a member of the National Ski Areas Association.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom safety padding design", "Custom sewing and fabrication", "Custom-fitted padding for poles, walls, and structures", "Custom colors and logo branding", "100% recyclable padding manufacturing", "Bulk and wholesale production", "Design consultation for unique spaces"], "industries": ["Ski areas", "Athletic facilities", "Playgrounds and parks", "Snow tubing parks", "Adventure parks", "Climbing gyms", "Ropes courses", "Amusement parks", "Schools", "Recreation centers", "Stadiums"], "materials": ["UV-resistant vinyl", "High-density foam", "Closed-cell foam", "Eco-friendly recyclable materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Thousands of pads per year", "lead_time": "3\u20136 weeks for custom projects", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Nearly 50 years of manufacturing expertise", "Premium all-weather materials (UV-resistant vinyl, high-density foam)", "Custom-fit solutions made to exact specifications", "Industry''s first 100% recyclable padding line", "Personal customer service from quote to delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1974 in Grangeville, Idaho -> /about-us", "Co-founders Will and Gail Williams -> /about-us", "Woman-owned, Idaho-based US manufacturer -> /about-us", "Started sewing truck seats -> /about-us", "Produces thousands of pads annually in Idaho facility -> /about-us", "Introduced 100% recyclable pads in 2022 -> /about-us", "Member of National Ski Areas Association -> /about-us", "Serves 600+ ski areas worldwide -> /", "Custom-fitted padding for ski areas, gyms, sports venues -> /", "Materials: UV-resistant vinyl, high-density foa